    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Fit logarithmic spirals to shell whorls and estimate constant angles with uncertainty for Nautilus, ammonitoids and gastropods. Test Nautilus against about 80 degrees and estimate the fraction of ordinary taxa inside 80–85 degrees or below 80 degrees.";
